abstract: >-
  Verified public records of AI-agent failures: what the agent controlled,
  what went wrong, what it cost, and what the evidence is. Open data, open
  submissions, verified registration. Individual records carry stable
  permalinks and per-record citation lines at https://piperoll.org.
